# Standing Stones costs one mana, a tap, and one life to add one mana of a chosen color (CR 605.1a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Standing Stones
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Standing Stones.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Battlefield.Standing Stones.Activate(Mana: short)
